WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.862
Learn is clear about three
things you must not do.

2
00:00:02.862 --> 00:00:04.787
Don't put secrets in a package.

3
00:00:04.787 --> 00:00:06.787
Don't exceed a hundred megabytes.

4
00:00:06.787 --> 00:00:08.933
And when you release a new version,

5
00:00:08.933 --> 00:00:14.068
give the package a new name but keep the
same policy identifier, raise the version,

6
00:00:14.068 --> 00:00:19.049
and let the hash be recomputed; change
only the address and the agent rejects it.

7
00:00:19.049 --> 00:00:24.337
The repository also pins Microsoft's
sample project, with hashes a test checks.

8
00:00:24.337 --> 00:00:27.776
It's five years older than
the module the chapter uses,

9
00:00:27.776 --> 00:00:31.762
and two things in it no longer
hold, including a renamed cmdlet.

10
00:00:31.762 --> 00:00:34.060
Its compiled file still packages.
